<title>JAPAN: JT 96/97 parent results on tobacco business.</title>
<headline>JT 96/97 parent results on tobacco business.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.74 trln	 vs	    2.66 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  146.76		vs	  116.12</p>
<p> Current	    136.76		vs	  116.35</p>
<p> Net		   79.54		vs	   66.13</p>
<p> EPS	     39,769.81 yen	  vs     33,062.62 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	     -		vs		 -</p>
<p> Ord div	   7000.00 yen	  vs	 7000.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Japan Tobacco Inc has the sole rights to produce tobacco in Japan. The figures are the company's parent results</p>
<p>in its tobacco business only.</p>
